Here's a quick buglet report for Redhat 4.0 on AXP (and possibly other
platforms):

	- I upgraded to 4.0 from 3.0.3, and began encountering an
	  error message at boot time from uname during the computation
	  of module dependencies.  The message was that uname couldn't
	  find libdl.so.2...  I was able to correct the problem by
	  copying libdl.* from /usr/lib to /lib.  This problem
