Assuming that you previously saw a blue screen at bootup and had the ARC
console, you probably have got dumped back into the SRM console. To get back
to ARC get to the >>> prompt and type:
set os_type NT  <enter>
power off and on the UDB.
You should now be at ARC console bootup.

