	4.54user 6.97system 0:12.05elapsed 95%CPU
	  15003   79006 2547805

	# grep user /proc/cpuinfo 
	user unaligned acc      : 5314468 (pc=120003b4c,va=120246717)

so 2.5M traps took ~1 user and ~7 system cpu secs  
