Chris Huffine wrote:
> linking /home/huffine/SatTrack/run/sattrack for a i386/Linux ...
> /usr/X11R6/lib/libXt.a(Initialize.o): In function `CombineUserDefaults':
> Initialize.c(.text+0x5c4): undefined reference to `XResourceManagerString'

Library ordering is important.  Put -lXt before -lXext before -lX11.

